00:00:56.020 --> 00:01:04.050
It took US 32 months to get to 10,000 subscribers,
32 almost three years to get to 10,000 subscribers

00:01:04.050 --> 00:01:07.920
to get from 10,000 to a hundred thousand.

00:01:07.920 --> 00:01:13.290
It took us only 30 months to get from 100
to 200,000.

00:01:13.290 --> 00:01:19.340
It took us only 17 months to get from 200
to 300,000 it took us 11 months.

00:01:19.340 --> 00:01:24.299
I think you see the trend to get from 300
to 400,000 subscribers.

00:01:24.299 --> 00:01:28.810
It took us eight months from 400 to 500,000
it took us 10 months.

00:01:28.810 --> 00:01:33.770
Things slow down, but then to go from 500
to 600 it took us seven months and we got

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:40.320
from 600,000 to 700,000 subscribers in only
four months.

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:47.110
