00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:06.119
So that gets to why I said this is an awesome
accomplishment, but not at a very good time.

00:02:06.119 --> 00:02:11.770
We are growing the number of subscribers on
the youtube channel very quickly at a time

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:17.350
when youtube is deprioritizing independent
news and politics, content in favor of corporate

00:02:17.350 --> 00:02:18.940
legacy media channels.

00:02:18.940 --> 00:02:20.240
Not Good.

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:23.000
Youtube is increasingly demonetizing our videos.

00:02:23.000 --> 00:02:24.080
Even when people watch them.

00:02:24.080 --> 00:02:27.410
Very often the videos don't have ads playing,
meaning that we lose the revenue on those

00:02:27.410 --> 00:02:28.410
videos.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:32.950
A new one that I haven't even opened the door
about is that youtube is now branding a lot

00:02:32.950 --> 00:02:37.701
of our content and other news in politics,
content as adult or sensitive, where you have

00:02:37.701 --> 00:02:42.970
